.Dd March 12, 2026
.Dt PM_SUSPEND 9
.Os Substrate
.Sh NAME
.Nm pm_suspend
.Nd suspend and resume device-model trees
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In kern/device.h
.Ft int
.Fn device_suspend_all "pm_state_t state"
.Ft int
.Fn device_resume_all void
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn device_suspend_all
walks the registered bus trees and suspends root devices recursively.
.Fn device_resume_all
performs the inverse traversal and resumes suspended devices.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr device_pm 9
